# fields-2 — шаги записи (что показывается — fields-2.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчания; каждый следующий начинается заходом в настройки: таблица Values Status.
open Values.md
caret - #todo || call the bank
say Default: Status next walks its Values
cmd status-next
cmd status-next
expect - #done || call the bank / - #done || pay the rent

say Add Value → #waiting
settings Tags & PKM
fill #tag / tag = waiting
click Add Value
close
caret - #done || pay the rent
say Status next → the new Value comes after #done
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || call the bank / - #waiting || pay the rent

say Eye → #doing is hidden
settings Tags & PKM
click Hide #doing from next, previous and tagWheel
close
caret - #todo || call the bank
say Status next → #doing is skipped
cmd status-next
expect - #done || call the bank / - #done || pay the rent

say Show → custom: #todo is drawn as 🎯
settings Tags & PKM
pick Show, for #todo = custom
fill Custom text for #todo = 🎯
close
caret - #todo || call the bank
say Priority next → 🎯 stays in place of #todo
cmd priority-next
expect - #todo #low || call the bank / - #done || pay the rent
